{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-28","kind":"proposition","title":"平行线判定：同位角相等或同旁内角互补","englishTitle":"If a straight line falling on two straight lines make the exterior angle equal to the interior and opposite angle on the same side, or the interior angles on the same side equal to two right angles, the straight lines will be parallel to one another.","book":1,"number":28,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.28","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.28/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":28,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","contentId":"euclid-1-28","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b8e5f93bd82367706cc543b860308e7644eb2e1f7b4313e50a64b950aa2e2aba","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-28.statement","euclid-1-28.construction.1","euclid-1-28.proof.1","euclid-1-28.proof.2","euclid-1-28.proof.3","euclid-1-28.construction.2","euclid-1-28.proof.4","euclid-1-28.conclusion","euclid-1-28.historical.1","euclid-1-28.historical.2","euclid-1-28.historical.3","euclid-1-28.historical.4","euclid-1-28.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-28.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-28","revisionId":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b59ea18f598c010c30c45a5f471e75464eadcc55ffe0412ab97542f1d1656b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line falling on two straight lines make the exterior angle equal to the interior and opposite angle on the same side, or the interior angles on the same side equal to two right angles, the straight lines will be parallel to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线相交两条直线,使外部角等于同一侧的非相邻内部角,或同一侧的内部角等于两条直角,则直线将平行。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线有他直线交加其上若外角与同方相对之内角等或同方两内角与两直角等即两直线必平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条线与其他线相交，或者外角等于对面内角，或者同一正方形的两个内角等于两个直角，则这两条线必须平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-28.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-28","revisionId":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9fd3d8ae42df8d3cb1580ef13b6c1b306addc7bc376078a128320b0246c6adf7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the straight line EF falling on the two straight lines AB, CD make the exterior angle EGB equal to the interior and opposite angle GHD, or the interior angles on the same side, namely BGH, GHD, equal to two right angles;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线EF横交两条直线AB、CD使外部角EGB等于不相邻的内角GHD或同一侧的内部角BGH、GHD等于2 直角;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-28.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-28","revisionId":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a70769596aead094788ba935aaa1c0080594eee266333c4710c7128e894cdc9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that AB is parallel to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"要证明：直线 AB 平行于直线 CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-28.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-28","revisionId":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"91a5708f859acf2f340fd669cd39659c3e86cb4f9dfc5430c3a8933cfeaa0158","citations":["euclid-1-15","euclid-1-27"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the angle EGB is equal to the angle GHD, while the angle EGB is equal to the angle AGH, [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)] the angle AGH is also equal to the angle GHD; and they are alternate; therefore AB is parallel to CD. [[I. 27](/principles/euclid-1-27)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,EGB角等于GHD角,EGB角等于AGH角,AGH角也等于GHD角,它们相互交替,因此AB角与CD角平行。 [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)] [[I. 27](/principles/euclid-1-27)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-28.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-28","revisionId":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"662733c017dc60a08547210c882ad4ab5e6fb83613ac5caae3fe87eea6f06811","citations":["euclid-1-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the angles BGH, GHD are equal to two right angles, and the angles AGH, BGH are also equal to two right angles, [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)] the angles AGH, BGH are equal to the angles BGH, GHD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于角度BGH,GHD等于2,直角,角度AGH,BGH也等于2,直角,角度AGH,BGH等于角度BGH,GHD。 [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-28.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-28","revisionId":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7e74dbf8e00f1bb2fd7d82cc137d9c768b784bf030b4519f413b39ecb146ec91","citations":["euclid-1-27"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle BGH be subtracted from each; therefore the remaining angle AGH is equal to the remaining angle GHD; and they are alternate; therefore AB is parallel to CD. [[I. 27](/principles/euclid-1-27)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将每个角度的BGH角减去;因此,其余角度的AGH等于其余角度的GHD;它们是交替的;因此,AB是平行的CD。 [[I. 27](/principles/euclid-1-27)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-28.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-28","revisionId":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-28.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-28","revisionId":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-28.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-28","revisionId":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e41c125084109eb2c6445167ece9bee22343abb198fe3a2d38f3798f4169f78a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线有他直线交加其上若外角与同方相对之内角等或同方两内角与两直角等即两直线必平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条线与其他线相交，或者外角等于对面内角，或者同一正方形的两个内角等于两个直角，则这两条线必须平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-28.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-28","revisionId":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2802404419891b8d7e804f14f7a3f6049a9259d1a792db94825881cb99b41cbe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先解曰：甲乙丙丁两直线加他直线戊己交于庚于辛其戊庚甲外角与同方相对之庚辛丙内角等题言甲乙丙丁两线必平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先，解释如下：甲乙丙丁，两条线加上其他线 戊己 在 辛 处于 庚 相交，戊庚甲 是外角位于同一侧，对应的 庚辛丙 为内角，相等。命题解释：甲乙丙丁 两条线必须平行"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-28.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-28","revisionId":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e7056c34f1a43ce42befa8edef16aa553883eed35b09ffc972d9d120cacefb4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：乙庚辛角与相对之内角丙辛庚等〈本篇〉〈卄七〉戊庚甲与乙庚辛两交角亦等〈本篇十五〉即两直线必平行后解曰：甲庚辛丙辛庚两内角与两直角等题言甲乙丙丁两线必平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：乙庚辛 该角与对角的内角 丙辛庚 相等 〈本篇〉〈卄七〉戊庚甲，并且与 乙庚辛 的两个交角也相等。〈本篇十五〉 意味着这两条线必须平行。解释之后：甲庚辛丙辛庚 两个内角和两个直角，相等。命题解释 甲乙丙丁 两条线必须平行"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-28.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-1-28","revisionId":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c3007ea0e6bb28dcf7eb09185f16cbd7b1c4514048b8a3dde5b37105d9c6ec4c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲庚辛丙辛庚两角与两直角等而甲庚戊甲庚辛两角亦与两直角等〈本篇十三〉试减同用之甲庚辛即所存甲庚戊与丙辛庚等矣既外角与同方相对之内角等即甲乙丙丁必平行〈本题〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲庚辛丙辛庚 这两个角等于两个直角，并且 甲庚戊甲庚辛 的两个角也等于两个直角。〈本篇十三〉 尝试减去相同的 甲庚辛，即存储的 甲庚戊 和 丙辛庚。由于外角和同侧内角相等，即 甲乙丙丁 必须平行 〈本题〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-28.source","contentId":"euclid-1-28","revisionId":"euclid-1-28@raw-b8e5f93bd8236770","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"231aeb8699a44e627dd1a82145e03052fbdd55aa0b11ae99132406afb54be361","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.28/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.28\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-28:euclid-1-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-28","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-28.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.28","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.28/","sourceLabel":"I. 15"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-28:euclid-1-27:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-28","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-28.proof.2","euclid-1-28.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-27","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.28","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.28/","sourceLabel":"I. 27"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-28:euclid-1-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-28","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-28.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.28","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.28/","sourceLabel":"I. 13"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-7:euclid-1-28:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-7.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-28","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.7/","sourceLabel":"I. 28"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-4:euclid-1-28:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-4.proof.2","euclid-6-4.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-28","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"I. 28"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-6:euclid-1-28:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-6.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-28","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.6/","sourceLabel":"I. 28"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-18:euclid-1-28:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-18.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-28","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.18/","sourceLabel":"I. 28"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-28:euclid-1-15:explicit","id":"euclid-1-15","book":1,"number":15,"kind":"proposition","title":"对顶角相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-28:euclid-1-27:explicit","id":"euclid-1-27","book":1,"number":27,"kind":"proposition","title":"平行线判定：内错角相等，两直线平行","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-28:euclid-1-13:explicit","id":"euclid-1-13","book":1,"number":13,"kind":"proposition","title":"邻补角：直线上形成的两角和为平角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-7:euclid-1-28:explicit","id":"euclid-4-7","book":4,"number":7,"kind":"proposition","title":"在给定圆外作外切正方形","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-6-4:euclid-1-28:explicit","id":"euclid-6-4","book":6,"number":4,"kind":"proposition","title":"相似三角形对应边成比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-6:euclid-1-28:explicit","id":"euclid-11-6","book":11,"number":6,"kind":"proposition","title":"垂直同一平面的两条直线互相平行","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-18:euclid-1-28:explicit","id":"euclid-11-18","book":11,"number":18,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与角与线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-parallel","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
